{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>הַיְצֵא</b> — like <b>הַשְׁלֵם</b>, and likewise <b>הַיְשַׁר</b> לְפָנֶיךָ דַּרְכֶּךָ (Psalms 5:9)." "<b>ושרצו.</b> They shall give birth."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {0 "The implied grammatical point is that these are all imperative forms with definite-article prefix attached to a causative/hifil verb; the comparison is to forms like הוצא, השלם, הישר."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:43:48.441368649Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}